{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategy game brimming with calculated gambles and raw chance. Wield your guns, cards, and Snake Coins to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/89851f396c745d5190167b0ecfa6d8f1.avif?t=1771780942\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored and alone within the Shrine World, the Snake God conceived a grim diversion: a Deathmatch Tournament. He summoned wish-seekers from disparate worlds and manifested their deepest desires into deadly ammunition, strategic cards, and coveted chips. Now, they clash across the gaming tables in a contest proclaimed &quot;fair.&quot; Defeated seekers are forcibly returned to their worlds, all memories of the Shrine World purged. Winners advance through the brutal rounds, edging closer to the ultimate prize: the fulfillment of their heart's desire. But beware the Snake God's Smile... Is this god truly benevolent, or does his promise hide a venomous twist?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/e9dbbb5725695354b463a4b07644ae6d.avif?t=1771780942\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each gambler wields\u00a0two distinct types of specialized ammunition. Master their unique effects to unleash devastating and unexpected tactics upon your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/f7f7a6f707866e44aa926864109470b4.avif?t=1771780942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras_big/f7f7a6f707866e44aa926864109470b4.webp?t=1771780942 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/379e97c3d39967e604e60b9fd35db2f0.avif?t=1771780942\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think beyond your own firearms. The mind game is paramount. Wield your opponent's firearms against them, deduce the hidden payload in every chamber, and shatter their carefully laid traps. Every choice is a high-stakes gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/2f1cb6bac95f9c8834ce0118f27ac83d.poster.avif?t=1771780942\" width=780 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/2f1cb6bac95f9c8834ce0118f27ac83d.webm?t=1771780942\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/2f1cb6bac95f9c8834ce0118f27ac83d.mp4?t=1771780942\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/14ac7cb86367573a5d945fbbef786e07.avif?t=1771780942\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets aren't your only arsenal. Harness powerful card skills to dramatically alter the flow of battle. Time your plays perfectly to seize control and snatch victory from the jaws of defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/1162717b52f7fca0222f678ccec2023f.avif?t=1771780942\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras_big/1162717b52f7fca0222f678ccec2023f.webp?t=1771780942 width=1560 height=1457 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/78bb2a970a6f57291e0baebf7cfb24bf.avif?t=1771780942\" width=1560 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory demands more than cards and bullets. Strike bargains with the Snake God. Acquire potent boons to secure an insurmountable advantage and seal your triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/extras/13e648a89170d7fc1598a5b49ea7590c.avif?t=1771780942\" width=1522 height=852 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723990?t=1771780942","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723990?t=1771780942","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/c7cdaf64e3616c0e90114cfe99897cf236bd90bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771780942","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723990/c7cdaf64e3616c0e90114cfe99897cf236bd90bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771780942","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4063240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strategy game brimming with calculated gambles and raw chance. Wield your guns, cards, and Snake Coins to